<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Your Dira Health account was locked after <%= Devise.maximum_attempts %> failed sign-in
  attempts. If that was you, use the link below. If it was not, the lock did its job and
  your password still works.
</p>

<p><%= link_to "Unlock my account", unlock_url(@resource, unlock_token: @token) %></p>

<p>
  The account also unlocks on its own an hour after it was locked, so you can simply wait
  rather than use this link.
</p>
